{"metadata":{"taxon":[{"Plain":"Wiki. "},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"deRham叠"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},3],"title":[{"Plain":"“de Rham 叠”"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>由"},{"Local":{"url":"概形","text":"概形"}},{"Plain":" $X$ 可构造\n$$\r\nX_{\\text{dR}}\\colon \\mathsf {Sch}^{\\text{op}} \\to \\mathsf {Sets},\r\n$$\n满足\n$$\r\nX_{\\text{dR}}(S):=\\operatorname{Hom}(S_{\\text{red}},X),\r\n\\quad\r\n\\mathcal O_{S_{\\text{red}}} = \\mathcal O_S / \\text{nilpotent},\r\n$$\n$$\r\n\\mathsf {QCoh}(X_{\\text{dR}})\\simeq D\\mathsf {-Mod}(X).\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}